# StringZilla (vendored subset)

Upstream: https://github.com/ashvardanian/StringZilla (Apache-2.0, see LICENSE)
Pinned commit: 7fed3fb4201a34962cd456a4033bebc5ea09e74e (2026-08-12)

Vendored subset: include/stringzilla/{types.h, utf8_runes*, utf8_norm*,
utf8_wordbreaks*, utf8_sentences*, utf8_tokens*} only -- the UAX#15 normalization engine, its rune decode
helpers, and the UAX#29 word-break kernels used for A/B reference. Header-only
C; no upstream build files.

Consumed by libs/iresearch analysis. Conformance is gated on our side by
tests/libs/iresearch/analysis (UCD 17 NormalizationTest.txt), so snapshot
bumps must keep that suite green.
